<title>FRANCE: Credit Lyonnais economist to join CCF.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais economist to join CCF.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>French state-owned bank Credit Lyonnais' chief economist in Paris, Antoine Brunet, has been hired by Credit Commercial de France as chief market economist, sources at both banks said on Friday.</p>
<p>There was no immediate official comment from either bank.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
